    title: "ADR-0041 §1 tier axiom gets a reference frame (owner ruling 2026-10-25, option A): tier is distance FROM THE PROJECT of the code a node stands for -- rewrite §1, spec §14 and tier docstrings in place"  # 3efa
    status: todo_hard  # 3efa
    priority: 3  # 3efa
    parent:  # 3efa
    tags:  # 3efa
    - supply_chain  # 3efa
    - adr_0041  # 3efa
